Z||000012||Kelvin Vivian||11-04-2001||12:44 AM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.printroom.com/_vti_bin/ViewImage.dll?userid=no_18&album_id=36084&image_id=0&courtesy=1">  <BR>1987 4-cyl, SE, 5-spd, factory twin-pipe dual exhaust<P>A lot of people notice and ask questions about my holley side scoop, I just tell them it's an air-intake scoop. Since my 87 SE looks like a V6 Fiero, I need all the HP I can get...<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>KV<BR>87 SE 4-cyl, 5-spd<BR>88 GT T-Top, 5-spd||||reg||1
