Z||000015||Smokin' GT||11-04-2001||03:18 PM||||Ram Air simply does not exist, you WILL NOT gain a d*** thing.  The physics of the thing just doesn't work, no matter what kind of engine you have.  It's a marketing scam.  But they look cool and for some of you that's all that matters right?<P>------------------<BR>-87 Bright Blue Metallic GT-<BR>          -Joel||||reg||13
